{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OnboardingKit has types and views that can be used to tell users about new features and updates in an app. It keeps track of what the user has already seen, so that items are only presented once, with an opt-in to show all items on the first app launch.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Defining What’s New","anchor":"Defining-Whats-New"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/OnboardingWhatsNew"},{"text":" item describes a feature or change in a certain app version. It has a version, an optional title, a text, and an icon, which basically means that it’s a versioned ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/OnboardingUsp"},{"text":" and can be rendered as such:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let items: [OnboardingWhatsNew<Image>] = [","    .init(","        version: \"1.1\",","        title: \"Sync\",","        text: \"Your data now syncs between your devices.\",","        image: Image(systemName: \"icloud\")","    ),","    .init(","        version: \"1.2\",","        title: \"Widgets\",","        text: \"Add widgets to your **Home Screen**.\",","        image: Image(systemName: \"square.grid.2x2\")","    )","]"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Versions are compared numerically, which means that ","type":"text"},{"code":"1.10","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is considered to be after ","type":"text"},{"code":"1.9","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/OnboardingWhatsNewInfo"},{